        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YOWN-NIL, Yale Expressions Modern Holden Lever with Owen Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Holden Lever with Modern Owen Rose will fit many pre-drilled doors. The Owen Rosette with Holden Lever will fit 5-1/2 inch center to center prep and comes packaged with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. Choose from only the most popular finish color options. The Yale Expressions Modern Holden Lever with Owen Rosette is perfect for any home remodel project. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Holden Door Lever with Modern Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Holden Leverset with Owen Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry has a Schlage C keyway.</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YOWN-HLD-specifications.pdf?v=1704262435\"><b>Yale YOWN-HLD Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. \r\nLever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face). Package Includes: \r\n2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch \r\noperates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, \r\nstrike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. \r\nLatch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock \r\non both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Package Includes: \r\n2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Keyed:</b> Guarded latchbolt operated from outside by key; inside by lever. \r\nTurnbutton on the interior locks outside lever. Outside lever unlocks by key. \r\nComplete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Holden Lever with Modern Owen Rose",
                "description": "The Holden Lever with Modern Owen Rose will fit many pre-drilled doors. The Owen Rosette with Holden Lever will fit 5-1/2 inch center to center prep and comes packaged with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. Choose from only the most popular finish color options. The Yale Expressions Modern Holden Lever with Owen Rosette is perfect for any home remodel project.",
                "keywords": "Yale YOWN-HLD, Yale YOWN52.HLD, Yale YOWN23.HLD, Yale YOWN24.HLD, Yale YOWN25.HLD, Yale YOWN-HLD, Yale Expressions Holden Lever with Modern Owen Rosettes, Holden Lever with Owen Rosette, Owen Rosette with Holden Levers,"
